":"/stories"},"showTimecode":true},{"key":"philosophy","type":"philosophy","visible":true,"eyebrow":"What we keep","headline":"Not just how it looked.\n*But how it felt.*","body":"The nervous laughter. The trembling hands. The little glances no one else noticed. We capture the moments that happen between the moments — the ones that make your story entirely yours.","media":{"id":"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003","url":"/brand/holding-hands.jpg","type":"image","alt":"Bride and groom in white holding hands, bouquet of pink flowers","width":882,"height":1181,"poster":null,"isSample":false},"imageSide":"left"},{"key":"marquee","type":"marquee","visible":true,"words":["nervous laughter","trembling hands","quiet glances","happy tears","the in-between"]},{"key":"featured","type":"featured_stories","visible":true,"eyebrow":"Stories","headline":"Days, *remembered.*","body":"A few wedding stories, told the way they felt.","storyIds":[],"link":{"label":"See every story","href":"/stories"}},{"key":"break","type":"image_break","visible":true,"media":{"id":"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004","url":"/brand/family-portrait.jpg","type":"image","alt":"Family in white baju Melayu and wedding dresses laughing together","width":853,"height":1223,"poster":null,"isSample":false},"focal":"50% 35%","quote":"The people who make\n*the day yours.*","caption":""},{"key":"films","type":"films","visible":true,"eyebrow":"Films & reels","headline":"Little films.\n*Lasting feelings.*","body":"Your day unfolds in a thousand little moments. We bring them together in a way that lets you feel it all over again.","film":{"id":"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000028","url":"/brand/film.mp4","type":"video","alt":"Sample highlight film made from photos","width":1280,"height":720,"poster":"/brand/film-poster.jpg","isSample":true},"poster":{"id":"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000011","url":"/brand/film-poster.jpg","type":"image","alt":"Cover frame of the highlight film","width":1280,"height":720,"poster"